  "id": "leadership-theories",
  "term": "leadership theories",
  "definition": "In this packet, leadership theories refers to cognitive ideas or prototypes people use to judge who counts as a leader. These mental schemas emphasize certain attributes more than others, and their influence can depend on which other attributes are present and which leadership schema is activated.",
